      "text": "**Developing Canva Integration**\n\nI\u0027m currently focused on integrating the Canva Connect API within our Lovable-based SaaS. Supabase\u0027s backend and Edge Functions seem like a good fit. I\u0027m imagining a chat-based prompt system in Lovable for generating editable creatives. I\u0027ll need to figure out how to best integrate that prompt with the API.\n\n\n**Addressing Security, Cost, and Logic**\n\nI\u0027ve been working through the security concerns regarding API keys. I realize storing them directly in prompts or client-side code is a big no-no; environment variables within Supabase Secrets are the way to go. The Canva API free tier is promising, but I\u0027ll need to watch for potential costs with higher usage or premium features. Now, I\u0027m focusing on the logic, specifically on how Lovable will be built out. Currently on Step 1, which entails setting up an Edge Function.\n\n\n",
